{"id": "Derd9IvoWaj", "title": "Video by mariah_mpls", "description": "No, you don’t NEED AI to edit your videos. The process becomes a lot more manageable when you learn to think like an editor. That’s exactly what I’m going to teach you guys in this brand new series. 13+ years from my career as a video editor, distilled down for you. I’d rather give away all of my tips and tricks than see AI take over my algorithm. You absolutely CAN edit your own videos. Maybe no one has given you a clear road map. \n\nI edit all my content myself as a mom with 3 kids in the margins of my life. I have simple, repeatable workflows that make the process as easy as possible. \n\nSo excited to dive into this with you guys. Let’s raise the bar together.", "channel": "mariah_mpls", "uploader_id": "19178699", "uploader": "Mariah Marcía", "timestamp": 1792420363, "like_count": 49968, "comment_count": 941, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-987296807026498a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.681, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPhMAo3WOA4wrhwfcGw8SB0wtHnRnIzI_sGylxXwGLi-TzjhyOobM1HTaVGQS0jJsENYHuJUPyyca-Tk3EMCaBVx-V_C4SAfREZhFw.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=YAy6dHOQjRYQ7kNvwHlqFVr&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=yxI7KaP0Qc8hmKQvJkmZmQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQQWyQ-EsopAu5DoeOFnUVp530JKIFQHtWSpTtOwT8Hxg&oe=6B052BF9", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.681, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5